Package: plotomics
Type: Package
Title: High-Performance Bioinformatics Visualizations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Samuel", "Bharti", email = "samuel.bharti@posit.co",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Lightweight, GPU-accelerated bioinformatics visualization widgets
    (volcano plots, expression and clustered heatmaps, dot plots, stacked
    violins, embeddings, spatial tissue maps, oncoprints, protein domain
    lollipops, Kaplan-Meier curves, mutational signature profiles, UpSet plots,
    treemaps, networks, Hi-C contact matrices and genome viewers) backed by a
    shared JavaScript core and exposed to R through 'htmlwidgets'. Designed for
    large datasets that render smoothly in the browser, the RStudio Viewer,
    R Markdown, Quarto and Shiny.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    htmlwidgets
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    survival
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/samuelbharti/plotomics
BugReports: https://github.com/samuelbharti/plotomics/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
